- id: breach_of_lease
  name: Breach of Lease
  description: A claim that a landlord violated the terms of a lease agreement, such
    as failing to provide essential services or maintain the premises.
  jurisdiction: NYS
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id001
  - Breach of Contract
  - Landlord Breach of Contract
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/4289658/gary-hodge-and-robert-hart-iii-v-stephen-kraft-ind-and-as-member-on/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/2831336/coinmach-corp-fka-solon-automated-services-inc-v-aspenwood-apartment/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/4798112/gerald-dix-v-edelman-financial-services/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/7323114/federal-deposit-insurance-corp-v-dee/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/2170691/mbia-insurance-corp-v-federal-deposit-insurance/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/4281716/in-re-vsdh-vaquero-venture-ltd-and-douglas-m-hickok/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/9355567/terry-v-pub-serv-co-of-nc/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/8523899/giuliano-v-federal-deposit-insurance-in-re-downey-financial-corp/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/4274214/linda-s-nowlin-v-lori-keaton/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/4854807/12636-research-ltd-hsu-realty-company-inc-and-chi-kao-hsu-indian/
    - https://www.metcouncilonhousing.org/help-answers/if-you-want-to-break-your-lease/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/4798029/gerald-dix-v-edelman-financial-services/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/2831351/coinmach-corp-fka-solon-automated-services-inc-v-a/
    sample_quotes:
    - Plaintiff also asserted a claim for breach of contract.
    - Nowlin argues that Keaton breached the lease by failing to provide air conditioning
      and other essential services.
    - VSDH Vaquero Venture, Ltd. and Douglas M. Hickok appeal from a judgment in favor
      of appellees on their breach of contract claim.
    suggested_aliases: *id001
