- id: disability_ac_accommodation
  name: Disability Accommodation for Air Conditioning
  description: A claim that a landlord must reasonably accommodate a tenant's disability
    by allowing or facilitating air conditioning installation, including upgrading
    electrical systems, unless it causes undue hardship.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id006 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
