- id: failure_to_renew_lease
  name: Failure to Renew Lease
  description: A claim that a landlord failed to offer a renewal lease to a rent-stabilized
    tenant, entitling the tenant to withhold rent increases.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id017 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.metcouncilonhousing.org/help-answers/about-rent-stabilization/
