    sample_quotes:
    - your landlord must offer you a renewal lease in order to collect a rent increase.
      If your landlord doesn’t offer you a valid lease renewal, you don’t need to
      pay the increase
    - Rent stabilization means your rent increases are determined by the Rent Guidelines
      Board (Appointed by the Mayor) & that they landlord must renew your lease
    suggested_aliases: *id017
