    other conduct intended to force the tenant to vacate.
  jurisdiction: NYS
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id024 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.nysenate.gov/legislation/laws/PEN/241.05
    sample_quotes:
    - A person is guilty of harassment of a rent regulated tenant when he or she,
      with intent to induce a tenant to vacate a rent regulated dwelling unit... engages
      in a course of conduct which interferes with or disturbs the tenant's quiet
      enjoyment...
    suggested_aliases: *id024
