- id: senior_lease_termination
  name: Senior Lease Termination
  description: A right for tenants aged 62 or older to break a lease under specific
    circumstances, such as relocation to senior housing or medical necessity.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id040 []
  _bootstrap:
