- id: tenant_rights_roommate
  name: Tenant Rights for Roommates
  description: A roommate who has lived in the unit for at least 30 days or has a
    signed rental agreement has tenancy rights and cannot be evicted without proper
    legal process.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id043 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://housingcourtanswers.org/answers/for-tenants/roommate-issues/
    sample_quotes:
